  "decision_summary": "Direct systemic evidence from multiple retrieved molecules supports meaningful CNS access, including PGD2 brain uptake, GLUT1-mediated DHA brain accumulation, and 10-OH-NBP brain penetration. Negative PGE1 and vitamin C results are acknowledged, but the overall direct experimental record favors a pass, with low confidence due to limited structural similarity.",
